OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACoroner warns of risk of future
OL,4,Adeaths at mental health unit where
OL,5,Apatient was killed
OL,6,
OL,7,FA mental health trust in east London,
OL,8,Fwhere a man was killed by a fellow
OL,9,Fpatient, has been warned further deaths
OL,10,Fmay occur unless staff issues are
OL,11,Faddressed.
OL,13,FHugo Flint Cahan, 34, was strangled by
OL,14,F22-year-old Rolando Torres-Pena at
OL,15,FNewham Mental Health Centre, which
OL,16,Fprovides care for acutely mentally ill
OL,17,Fmen, in January 2023.
OL,19,FThe coroner has sent a report to the
OL,20,FTrust and NHS England raising serious
OL,21,Fconcerns about the care the two men
OL,22,Freceived.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
